  "prompts": [
    [
      7,
      "After steaming, the SAME white square ceramic casserole with short white handles rests on a trivet. It contains steamed pork and cabbage dumplings in layers: many SMALL thin square wonton wrappers, very soft, slightly translucent, WRINKLED and draping unevenly into the savory juices. No huge straight pasta sheet, no firm lasagna slab, no cheese, no cream, no brown crust. Cooked minced pork and cabbage visible in gaps, a shallow pool of clear light broth around edges. A slim thermometer probe checks the center, display turned away."
    ],
    [
      8,
      "Finished serving photograph in the SAME white square casserole and kitchen. Steamed pork and cabbage DUMPLINGS IN LAYERS, made of SMALL thin wonton wrappers, VERY SOFT, slightly translucent, crumpled and wrinkled. Show a modest serving spoon resting at the dish edge with a loose juicy spoonful: soft wonton folds drape over small cooked pork and cabbage bits, in a little clear light broth. The serving CANNOT stand as a rigid rectangular stack: it sags naturally. Main casserole top is irregular overlapping softened small wonton squares, with scallion and sesame garnish. No neatly cut square portions, no floating lasagna tower, no huge smooth pasta sheets, absolutely no cheese or béchamel, no thick creamy sauce, no baked crust. Appetizing honest home-cooked appearance, not food sculpture."
    ]
  ],
